OL,1,Vk4                               G8/8
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGFOURTEEN HELD IN DAWN
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGRAIDS
OL,5, Police are questioning 14 people after
OL,6, a series of dawn raids in connection
OL,7, with an alleged multi-million pound
OL,8, fraud conspiracy.
OL,10,FEighty police officers, some armed,
OL,11,Fand Inland Revenue officials swooped
OL,12,Fon homes and businesses in north London
OL,13,Fafter months of painstaking inquiries.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FA Scotland Yard spokesperson said
OL,16,Foperation "magneto" uncovered a large-
OL,17,Fscale conspiracy to defraud the Inland
OL,18,FRevenue and London clearing banks.
OL,20,FThe 14, including one woman, are being
OL,21,Fheld at several London police stations.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]FFromG20-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
